<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>               <fw type="sig" place="bottom">Lucinde I. P</fw>               <lb/>
<pb n="226" facs="#f0231"/>
<p>Du ha&#x017F;t Recht, das kleine Land-<lb/>
